== Effects ==
* 1/15 chance to increase [[damage]] by 0.5 for the current room each time an enemy dies.
** Samson's Lock can activate up to 10 times per room.
** The activation chance depends on the [[Attributes#Luck|Luck]] stat and goes up to 100% with 10 Luck.

== Notes ==
* The effect can also be activated by destroying {{e|Shopkeeper}}s.

== Synergies ==
* {{I|Lusty Blood}}: Both the item and the trinket stack, granting 1 damage per kill. With 100% proc rate on the Lock, Isaac may gain up to 10 damage after 10 kills.
* {{I|Rock Bottom}}: Preserves the highest bonus earned between rooms.
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: At base luck, having either increases the chance to 13% and having both to 25%.

== Interactions ==
* {{dlc|r}}[[Cards and Runes|Ace Cards]]: Enemies that are turned into [[pickup]]s don’t count towards the Samson's Lock counter.
* {{i|E. Coli}} / {{i|Flush!}}: Enemies that are turned into poop don't count towards the Samson's Lock counter.
* {{dlc+|rnr+}}[[Freeze|Freeze Effects]]: Enemies that are frozen don't count towards the Samson's Lock counter.
** Because of this interaction, when Isaac has {{i|Uranus}}, only enemies killed by icicles from statues, bombs, familiars and other sources will increment Samson's Lock's counter, thus rendering Samson's Lock quite difficult to use.{{dlc-}}

