== Trivia ==
* According to the Bible, [[Wikipedia:Samson|Samson]] was given supernatural strength by God to fight his enemies, the Philistines, and perform heroic acts; but when he was tricked into allowing his hair to be cut by a Philistine woman named Delilah, Samson was powerless.
* This trinket is a reference to the effect of {{i|Bloody Lust}} (Samson's starting item) in the original game, which was later changed in ''Rebirth'' and added in ''Afterbirth'' as the item {{I|Lusty Blood}}.
* This trinket has the same flavor text as {{t|Red Patch}}.

